1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Berte Kanutte Sørensdatter. She died in Bakke, Sirnes, Flekkefjord, of kidney disease. Buried in Sandnes, Høyland, Rogaland. Possible name on headstone: Berte Kanutte Dybdahl.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Census (folketellingen) from 1875, Berte Kanutte was just born and lived together with her parents and two brothers and three sisters in Graveren, Øvre Østraat 145b by Høyland, where her father was a teglverks-worker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father: Søren Sørensen. Born: 19/11-1834 in Kyllingstad, Gjesdahl parish (sogn), Rogaland county.  Her grandfather: Søren Reijersen. Kyllingstad. Her grandmother: Kisti Halvorsdatter. Kyllingstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her mother: Berthe Christine Tjølsdatter. Born: 27/11-1838 in Gjesdahl, Gjesdahl parish, Rogaland county. Her grandfather: Tjöl Tjölsen. Gjesdahl.  Her grandmother: Christine Aadnesdatter. Gjesdahl.
2 CONT
