2 CONT Jesper Rasmussen Haaland BIRTH	13 Sep 1843 Time kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	1944 (aged 100–101) Astoria, Clatsop County, Oregon, USA BURIAL	 Ocean View Cemetery Warrenton, Clatsop County, Oregon, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesper Rasmussen Håland Haaland Born 13 September 1843. # 73 https://media.digitalarkivet.no/en/view/1632/25 Øvre Håland Farm in Time, Rogaland, Norway. Baptized 8 October 1843 in Lye Parish. Son of Rasmus Jonsen of Eikeland & Mar
2 CONC ta Jespersdtr of Ravndal. Married First wife, Melia Gabrielsdtr, mother of Marte. Married second wife, Ingeborg Larsdtr Skjelset 29 August 1876. #50 https://media.digitalarkivet.no/en/view/6257/403 Emigrated to America, arriving 3
2 CONC 0 June 1883, #22. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070102340135
2 CONT
2 CONT Settling in Minnesota, by 1920 migrated to North Dakota by 1930 migrated to Oregon, lived out his life in Astoria. Father to Marte, Melia, Amelia, Rasmus, Lars, Rachel, Jasper, Julia, Norman. Died 31 May 1944
