1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ingeborg was born October 8, 1862 at  Oltedal. She was  the fourth  child of Ludvig Georg Einarson Oftedal and Karen Svensdtr. Nese. Her siblings were Einar, Sven, Inger, Hans, Ane and Berta. Ingeborg was a quiet, 
2 CONC thoughtful and good person as well as a good wife, mother and neighbor. She and Peder were very different with one on one side and one on the other side. She had a way of making peace and calming him when he became rambunctious. I
2 CONC n exchange, he was deeply respectful of her. One can remember only good about her.  When the children showed disrespect for her, Peder came unglued.  For him, Ingeborg was perfect. His big wish was that he would die first and that
2 CONC  he did. They had twelve children.  Three died when they were small. Ingeborg died on December 13, 1935 at 73 years old.
