0 @I6000000005606851251@ INDI
1 NAME Mari Tollaksdatter /Kartevoll/
2 GIVN Mari Tollaksdatter
2 SURN Kartevoll
2 _MARNM Kartevoll
1 NAME Mari Tollaksdatter Kartevoll
1 SEX F
