1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My mother was born Hanna Haugen, the youngest daughter of Anders Olsen Haugen. The Haugen family of Stavanger and the Rasmus Oftedals family in Sandnes were different in many ways, but they had one important thing 
2 CONC in common. They worked hard and they belived in God. When Hanna Haugen Oftedal became a Sandnes citizen she soon became a member of "Det Hvite Bånd" og senere i livet var hun med I Sandnes Pensjonist Kor  where she provided lyrics
2 CONC  for melodies her conductor husband composed, including Sandnes Pensjonist March. Most of all, she was the best mother anyone can have.
2 CONT
