2 CONT
2 CONT Gustava Lende Pedersen BIRTH	8 Feb 1866 Time, Time kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	2 Jun 1953 (aged 87) Clarkfield, Yellow Medicine County, Minnesota, USA BURIAL	 Spring Creek Lutheran Cemetery Yellow Medicine County, Minnes
2 CONC ota, USA
2 CONT
