2 CONT
2 CONT It appears that there are Memorials linked for 9 of Gustava and Nicolai Pedersen's 11 Children. Memorial links Welcome for George Peterson ( and Spouse Lillian) and Bergliot Pedersen Larson  ( Mrs. E.R.Larson) It appears maiden na
2 CONC mes of some Daughters spelled  Peterson or Petersen, Sons Peterson. (This happened often in same families after U.S. Immigration process.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Granite Falls Minnesota is in Yellow Medicine, Renville and Chippewa Counties in mN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Many U.S. Evangelical Lutheran Church Record Archives site the Family while they resided in Minnesota. It appears the Family was active at the  Spring Creek Lutheran Church in Clarksfield MN.
2 CONT
2 CONT See U.S Federal Census Reports for 1920, 1930,1940, more.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Son: Martin Leonard Peterson (Pedersen) 1979 Obituary  Lynner Funeral Home Obituary Clarksfield Son Martin went by Leonard Peterson. Leonard's Obituary sited his Parents Nicolai Njolstad Peterson  and Gustava Lende Peterson. Leona
2 CONC rd was born in Friendship Township MN and attended a country school and school in Cottonwood. Leonard worked  construction. Leonard worked construction during WWII in the Pearl Harbor Navy Yards for four years. Leonard also worked
2 CONC  construction in Chicago. Leonard married Camilla Jacobson and they had children. Leonard's Obituary includes his Siblings names. In 1979 George Peterson was  living in Laguna Hills California. Bergliot Larson was living in Evelet
2 CONC h Minnesota. (Lynner Obituary online)
2 CONT
2 CONT ( Leonard on most Census reports, M.Leonard Peterson on grave marker)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT (Memorials Welcome for Children George & Bergliot, their Spouses, family)
2 CONT
2 CONT Gustava and Nicolai's Son : George Peterson born abt 1901 U.S. ELCA archives site George LeRay Pedersen and Perry Leray Pedersen being born July 14, 1901. ( Two  different entries) It sites George being baptized in Cottonwood. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ELCA Lutheran Church Archives: George LeRay Pedersen Baptism Born: July 14, 1901 Baptism: Aug. 4, 1901 Baptism Place: Cottonwood Parents: Necalai Pedersen Gustava Pedersen Church: Spring Creek Lutheran Church Church Location: Clar
2 CONC ksfield MN
2 CONT
