2 CONT
2 CONT Perry Leray Pedersen sites Perry born to Nicolas Pedersen and Gustava Pedersen  Baptism: Aug. 4, 1901 at Spring Creek Lutheran Church in Clarksfield MN. Baptism in Maynard Minnesota.
2 CONT
2 CONT Possible errors in the transcriptions and not known if there were two children or if both entries for George.
