1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/ft/person/pf01038012003751 Folketellingen 1865] - 9 år, Romibakken, , 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole, along with brother Martin came to the US in  1879.  According to the 1900 Illinois census Ole immigrated from Norway and lived at 283 W. Ohio St. in Chicago with his wife Helen.  Ole and brother John married sisters, Helen an
2 CONC d Minnie Olsen.  He lived at the Bethesda nursing home in Chicago from 1937 until his death in 1940. Note: When Helen and Minnie left Norway, their surname was Linneberg but when they came to the US they lived with a family named 
2 CONC Olsen so then they used the Olsen name.
