2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Andreas Oleson Lovaas was born in 1822 in Norway. He died in Batalden, Norway on 14 March 1869, at the age of 47.  The Batalden islands are off the northwest coast of Norway.  The name Batalden stems from the big island a little t
2 CONC o the north of Fanøya. Batalden Havbu is a small island just of the coast close to the town of Floro. You have to take a ferry to get there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andreas married Bertha Gurine Aslaksdatter. Bertha was born in Norway in November of 1819. Bertha reached 94 years of age and died in Highwater Township, Cottonwood County, Minnesota on 08 September 1914.  Andreas and Bertha (Asla
2 CONC ksdatter) Lovaas had six children.
