2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/92403329/elling-johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT Born Elling Jonassen to parents Jonas Ellingsen and Ingeborg Gurina Hansdatter, he married Martha Dorthea Omundsdr on August 9, 1875. To this union were born five children: Ingeborg, Aagot, Amelia, Inga, (who died at sea) and Hans
2 CONC  Froiland. He married his second wife, Severine Hagen, in 1904.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary:
2 CONT Elling Johnson, 84 Cooperstown, North Dakota, resident, died Saturday in a Fargo hospital where he had been a patient since April 21. He was born in Norway, Dec. 26, 1850.
2 CONT
2 CONT He leaves four children, Mrs. C. Seldal, Hans Froiland, Mrs. Jesper Taxdahl and Mrs. Ingeborg Anderson, all of Cooperstown, a brother, Carl John, St. Cloud, and two sisters and a brother in Norway. There are 23 grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be Tuesday in the Norwegian Lutheran Church in Cooperstown, of which he was a member. The date has not been set. Interment will be in Westley cemetery. The body will be taken from the O.J. Hanson funeral home
2 CONC  to Cooperstown today, where it will lie in the Quam Funeral Home.
2 CONT
