1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/92403349/hans_johan-froiland
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN: Elwin J. Froiland (30 Dec 1908 - 27 Sep 1998), Irwin H. Froiland (12 May 1910 - Jul 1984), Ovidia M. Tompkins, and Lloyd Froiland
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held Monday afternoon in Bethlehem Free Church in Cooperstown for Hans Froiland, 70, who died Friday morning in the local hospital after a long illness.
2 CONT Officiating at the funeral were the Rev. Arvid Nyquist and the Rev. Sanford Soma, with burial in Westley Cemetery south of Cooperstown.
2 CONT Mr. Froiland was born June 26, 1884 on the farm home of his parents near Cooperstown, then Dakota Territory. He grew to manhood here and married Louise Carstens at Cooperstown July 27, 1907. They farmed south of town until 1941 wh
2 CONC en they retired to town.
2 CONT Besides his wife, he leaves three sons, Irvin of Cooperstown, Alvin of Fargo, and Lloyd of Pomona, Calif.; a daughter, Mrs. H. P. (Ovidia) Tomkins, Pasadena, Calif.; three sisters, Mrs. Inga Anderson and Mrs. Christ Seldal, both C
2 CONC ooperstown, and Mrs. Serena Haaland, Portland, Ore., and 11 grandchildren.
2 CONT Published in the Griggs County Sentinel-Courier, Cooperstown, North Dakota, March 10, 1955.
2 CONT Submitted by Dennis C. Olson #48363213
2 CONT
